<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>treated with tents</i>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοτοί</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>used with such tents</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.125
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. σύστασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					13.500
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἀγωγή</span> treatment
				<i>by tents</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμοτον τῶνδ᾽ ἄκος</span>
			(Schütz for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκάς</span>) <i>a
				salve</i> or <i>plaster to heal</i> these wounds, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				471
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
